## Result in one sentence

**P4 produced the first preregistered Gate-P speed win against direct/no-rewrite at the ANF-lowering stage: propagated construction-time two-support signatures reduced case-balanced lowering time to 0.5752× direct, while also cutting pair-product work to 0.0984× direct. However, the current Python `MetaFactory` makes DAG construction expensive enough that construction+lowering remains 2.2259× direct.**

